  original_source: src/content/docs/giveth-donations.md
  notes: >-
    Protocol that streams tokens by the second rather than in one-off
    chunks; powers Giveth's recurring-donation "Stream Balance" feature,
    currently on Optimism or Base only, with ETH, OP, DAI, USDC, and GIV
    eligible per the article. No standalone URL given in this article.
